{"seq":4,"slug":"distributed-tracing","title":"分布式链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/distributed-tracing","wordCount":877,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式链路追踪\">分布式链路追踪</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>在微服务架构中，一个用户请求可能经过数十个服务。当请求变慢或失败时，定位问题根因变得极其困难。分布式链路追踪通过为每个请求分配唯一标识，串联起请求在所有服务中的调用链路，是微服务可观测性（Observability）的核心支柱之一。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性三支柱\">可观测性三支柱</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  O[可观测性] --&gt; L[日志 Logs]&#10;  O --&gt; M[指标 Metrics]&#10;  O --&gt; T[链路追踪 Traces]&#10;  L --&gt; L1[结构化事件记录]&#10;  M --&gt; M1[聚合数值时序数据]&#10;  T --&gt; T1[请求调用链路]\">graph TD\n  O[可观测性] --&gt; L[日志 Logs]\n  O --&gt; M[指标 Metrics]\n  O --&gt; T[链路追踪 Traces]\n  L --&gt; L1[结构化事件记录]\n  M --&gt; M1[聚合数值时序数据]\n  T --&gt; T1[请求调用链路]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>支柱</th>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>代表工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td>事件文本</td>\n<td>发生了什么？</td>\n<td>ELK、Loki</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标</td>\n<td>聚合数值</td>\n<td>系统整体状况如何？</td>\n<td>Prometheus、Grafana</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链路追踪</td>\n<td>调用链</td>\n<td>这个请求经历了什么？</td>\n<td>Jaeger、Zipkin、Tempo</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"trace-与-span\">Trace 与 Span</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  subgraph &quot;Trace (一次完整请求)&quot;&#10;    A[&quot;Span A: API Gateway&lt;br/&gt;200ms&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Span B: Order Service&lt;br/&gt;150ms&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Span C: Inventory Service&lt;br/&gt;50ms&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;Span D: Payment Service&lt;br/&gt;80ms&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;Span E: User Service&lt;br/&gt;30ms&quot;]&#10;  end\">graph LR\n  subgraph \"Trace (一次完整请求)\"\n    A[\"Span A: API Gateway&lt;br/&gt;200ms\"] --&gt; B[\"Span B: Order Service&lt;br/&gt;150ms\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Span C: Inventory Service&lt;br/&gt;50ms\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"Span D: Payment Service&lt;br/&gt;80ms\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"Span E: User Service&lt;br/&gt;30ms\"]\n  end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Trace</td>\n<td>一次完整请求的调用链，由唯一 TraceID 标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span</td>\n<td>调用链中的一个操作单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parent Span</td>\n<td>调用方的 Span</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SpanContext</td>\n<td>TraceID + SpanID + 采样标记 + Baggage</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"span-数据结构\">Span 数据结构</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;traceId&quot;: &quot;abc123def456&quot;,&#10;  &quot;spanId&quot;: &quot;span-001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parentSpanId&quot;: &quot;root&quot;,&#10;  &quot;operationName&quot;: &quot;POST /api/orders&quot;,&#10;  &quot;serviceName&quot;: &quot;order-service&quot;,&#10;  &quot;startTime&quot;: &quot;2024-01-15T10:30:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;duration&quot;: 150,&#10;  &quot;tags&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;http.method&quot;: &quot;POST&quot;,&#10;    &quot;http.status_code&quot;: 200,&#10;    &quot;db.type&quot;: &quot;mysql&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;logs&quot;: [{ &quot;timestamp&quot;: &quot;...&quot;, &quot;message&quot;: &quot;query executed in 5ms&quot; }]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"traceId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"abc123def456\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"spanId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"span-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parentSpanId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"root\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"operationName\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"POST /api/orders\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"serviceName\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-service\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"startTime\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2024-01-15T10:30:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"duration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tags\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"http.method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"POST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"http.status_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"db.type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mysql\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"logs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"timestamp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"message\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"query executed in 5ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"上下文传播\">上下文传播</h2><p>追踪信息需要在服务间传递，常用方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传播方式</th>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HTTP Header</td>\n<td>W3C Trace Context</td>\n<td>traceparent/tracestate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP Header</td>\n<td>B3 (Zipkin)</td>\n<td>X-B3-TraceId 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC Metadata</td>\n<td>W3C / B3</td>\n<td>Metadata key-value</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列 Header</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>消息头中携带 TraceContext</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"W3C Trace Context:&#10;traceparent: 00-abc123def456-span001-01&#10;             版本-TraceID-ParentSpanID-采样标记\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>W3C Trace Context:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>traceparent: 00-abc123def456-span001-01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>             版本-TraceID-ParentSpanID-采样标记</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"opentelemetry\">OpenTelemetry</h2><p>OpenTelemetry（OTel）是 CNCF 的可观测性标准，统一了追踪、指标和日志的采集：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[Application] --&gt;|SDK| C[OTel Collector]&#10;  C --&gt;|Export| J[Jaeger]&#10;  C --&gt;|Export| P[Prometheus]&#10;  C --&gt;|Export| L[Loki]\">graph LR\n  A[Application] --&gt;|SDK| C[OTel Collector]\n  C --&gt;|Export| J[Jaeger]\n  C --&gt;|Export| P[Prometheus]\n  C --&gt;|Export| L[Loki]</pre><h3 id=\"集成示例\">集成示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from opentelemetry import trace&#10;from opentelemetry.sdk.trace import TracerProvider&#10;from opentelemetry.sdk.trace.export import BatchSpanProcessor&#10;from opentelemetry.exporter.otlp.proto.grpc.trace_exporter import OTLPSpanExporter&#10;&#10;provider = TracerProvider()&#10;processor = BatchSpanProcessor(OTLPSpanExporter(endpoint=&quot;http://otel-collector:4317&quot;))&#10;provider.add_span_processor(processor)&#10;trace.set_tracer_provider(provider)&#10;&#10;tracer = trace.get_tracer(__name__)&#10;&#10;def process_order(order_id):&#10;    with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;process_order&quot;) as span:&#10;        span.set_attribute(&quot;order.id&quot;, order_id)&#10;        validate_order(order_id)&#10;        charge_payment(order_id)&#10;&#10;def validate_order(order_id):&#10;    with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;validate_order&quot;):&#10;        pass&#10;&#10;def charge_payment(order_id):&#10;    with tracer.start_as_current_span(&quot;charge_payment&quot;):&#10;        pass\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry.sdk.trace </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TracerProvider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry.sdk.trace.export </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BatchSpanProcessor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry.exporter.otlp.proto.grpc.trace_exporter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OTLPSpanExporter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">provider </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TracerProvider()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">processor </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BatchSpanProcessor(OTLPSpanExporter(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"http://otel-collector:4317\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">provider.add_span_processor(processor)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trace.set_tracer_provider(provider)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tracer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace.get_tracer(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__name__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"process_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        span.set_attribute(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order.id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        validate_order(order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        charge_payment(order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validate_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"validate_order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> charge_payment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_id):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tracer.start_as_current_span(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"charge_payment\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pass</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"采样策略\">采样策略</h2><p>全量采集所有请求的追踪数据成本过高，需要采样：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定比例</td>\n<td>采集 1% 或 10% 的请求</td>\n<td>高流量通用场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率限制</td>\n<td>每秒最多采集 N 条</td>\n<td>控制成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应</td>\n<td>根据流量动态调整比例</td>\n<td>波动流量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部采样</td>\n<td>请求完成后根据结果决定</td>\n<td>重点采集异常请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>始终采样</td>\n<td>采集所有请求</td>\n<td>低流量/关键服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from opentelemetry.sdk.trace.sampling import TraceIdRatioBased, ParentBased&#10;&#10;sampler = ParentBased(&#10;    root=TraceIdRatioBased(0.1)&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> opentelemetry.sdk.trace.sampling </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TraceIdRatioBased, ParentBased</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sampler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ParentBased(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    root</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">TraceIdRatioBased(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"追踪系统对比\">追踪系统对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>存储后端</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Jaeger</td>\n<td>Cassandra/ES/内存</td>\n<td>CNCF 项目、功能全面</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zipkin</td>\n<td>MySQL/ES/内存</td>\n<td>轻量、社区成熟</td>\n<td>中小规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tempo</td>\n<td>对象存储</td>\n<td>Grafana 生态、低成本</td>\n<td>大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SkyWalking</td>\n<td>ES/BanyanDB</td>\n<td>APM 全功能、Java 友好</td>\n<td>Java 生态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Datadog APM</td>\n<td>SaaS</td>\n<td>全托管、关联性强</td>\n<td>不想自建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"指标监控-metrics\">指标监控（Metrics）</h2><p>配合链路追踪，RED 指标（Rate、Error、Duration）是微服务监控的核心：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>告警阈值示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rate</td>\n<td>请求速率（QPS）</td>\n<td>QPS 突降 50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Error</td>\n<td>错误率</td>\n<td>错误率 &gt; 1%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Duration</td>\n<td>请求延迟</td>\n<td>P99 &gt; 500ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Prometheus 告警规则示例&#10;groups:&#10;  - name: service-alerts&#10;    rules:&#10;      - alert: HighErrorRate&#10;        expr: rate(http_requests_total{status=~&quot;5..&quot;}[5m]) / rate(http_requests_total[5m]) &gt; 0.01&#10;        for: 5m&#10;        labels:&#10;          severity: critical\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Prometheus 告警规则示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service-alerts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">HighErrorRate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m]) / rate(http_requests_total[5m]) > 0.01</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>使用 OpenTelemetry 作为统一的可观测性采集标准</li>\n<li>生产环境使用尾部采样——优先采集异常和慢请求</li>\n<li>为每个服务的入口和出口调用自动注入 Span</li>\n<li>TraceID 透传到日志中，实现日志与追踪的关联查询</li>\n<li>建立 SLO（服务等级目标），基于 RED 指标设置告警</li>\n<li>追踪数据保留周期根据成本调整——热数据 7 天，冷数据归档</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>链路追踪通过为每个请求分配唯一 TraceID，把跨数十个服务的调用串联成一条可下钻的链，是微服务可观测性的核心支柱之一。它的三个关键点是：Trace/Span 的层级模型（父子关系还原调用树）、上下文传播（W3C Trace Context 或 B3 让标识跨服务传递）、采样策略（生产环境优先尾部采样，重点保留异常与慢请求）。要真正发挥价值，还需把 TraceID 透传进日志实现关联查询，并让 RED 指标与追踪互补，共同支撑 SLO 告警。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式链路追踪","id":"分布式链路追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性三支柱","id":"可观测性三支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Trace 与 Span","id":"trace-与-span"},{"level":3,"text":"Span 数据结构","id":"span-数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文传播","id":"上下文传播"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry","id":"opentelemetry"},{"level":3,"text":"集成示例","id":"集成示例"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略","id":"采样策略"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪系统对比","id":"追踪系统对比"},{"level":2,"text":"指标监控（Metrics）","id":"指标监控-metrics"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"API 网关与 BFF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/microservices/api-gateway"},"next":{"title":"消息队列模型与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems/messaging-and-streaming/message-queue"}}